  "prefLabel": "Rev 205.01 Authority of Presiding Officer",
  "priorExpiration": "2006-05-19",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 205.01 Authority of Presiding Officer. The presiding officer shall have all authority with respect to the conduct of proceedings enjoyed by the department including but not limited to, the power to administer oaths, question any person who testifies, and direct the course of the proceeding.\n\nSource. #4060, eff 5-29-86, EXPIRED: 5-29-92\n\nNew. #5423, eff 6-23-92; ss by #6749, eff 5-19-98, EXPIRED: 5-19-06\n\nNew. #8658-A, eff 6-13-06; ss by #11185-A, eff 9-20-16",
